{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Eternal Holy City" Okhema|update|Fortunately, the "Rosy Celestial Maiden" fiasco was quickly resolved before the Chrysos Heirs discovered it. As a token of gratitude for saving Okhema from Nikador, Aglaea seems to have prepared a special gift for us.}}
